  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.66.2 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Enhancements 🔥\n* Improve display and handling of deleted submodules and nested repos/worktrees by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6134\n### Fixes 🔧\n* Fix diff rendering after scrolling far down by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6120\n* Make double-click detection more precise by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6123\n* Exit gracefully when a repo or worktree gets deleted from under lazygit by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6129\n* Fix \"Jump to File\" menu showing only half of the entries, in some rare cases by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6136\n### Maintenance ⚙️\n* Restore the terminal more reliably after a panic by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6124\n* Bump github.com/xo/terminfo from 1.0.0 to 1.2.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6053\n* Bump go version to 1.26 by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6137\n* Bump golang.org/x/sys from 0.47.0 to 0.49.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6125\n* Bump golang.org/x/sync from 0.22.0 to 0.24.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6127\n* Bump github.com/cli/go-gh/v2 from 2.13.0 to 2.16.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6128\n* Bump github.com/gdamore/tcell/v3 from 3.5.0 to 3.6.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6126\n### Performance Improvements 📊\n* Improve performance with very long diffs by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6121\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/compare/v0.66.1...v0.66.2\n\n",
